! ------------ !
! Subjunctions
! ------------ !

!! Subjunctions are assigned the morphological tag +CS.
!! The continuation lexicon CS terminates the wordform.
!! Complex subjunctions are entered as separate lexical items.

LEXICON CS
+CS: # ;


!! Forms marked for exclusion from normative use.

LEXICON Cs_elid
+CS+Use/Elid: # ;


!! Lexical entries

LEXICON Subjunction

го          CS       "that" ;
гу          CS       "like" ; !! to disambiguate from "like Adv"?
еслэ        CS       "if" ;
коале       CS       "if" ;
коаль       Cs_elid ;
куэссь      CS       "when" ;
потомуштэ   CS       "because" ;
штобэ       CS ;
штоб        Cs_elid ;
штэ         CS       "that" ;


!! TODO
!!
!! Check whether да also functions as a subjunction.
!! Check complex subjunctions, e.g. если … так и …